{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgetable is a colourful single player point and click game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's about helping to detect misplaced items visitors have left behind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The menu shows an image of places (buildings) they visited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can start from any building and return to the menu at any time without losing progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no levels in the traditional sense. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a free\u2011choice experience: explore each building in any order until all are cleared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to find objects that are misplaced and don't belong to the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated duration ~ 1.5 - 2.5 hours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some scenes are hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use help through a phone button to navigate you through the search.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a cursor hint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clicking on object, click on pick up button. Menu appears on right click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no timer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are click and right click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are different 9+ scenes with 350+ objects to be found.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 achievements for finding 20, 100, 250 and 370 objects.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"10 Items","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119800/bb968f15d992440f7d568730c0517265d757e1b0.jpg"},{"name":"40 Items","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119800/2069ce1aeb04ef404890af2b63d69c1d9acc4349.jpg"},{"name":"100 Items","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119800/6e4e27e831d415d353f5ee6b8ac3e3d5fdf53af0.jpg"},{"name":"180 Items","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119800/ee2170e9c584ae7addec3d7253995c173020197c.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119800?t=1774743134","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119800?t=1774743134","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119800/79ba7e98bb87db8d72189bbd97d5e74815b977a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774743134","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119800/79ba7e98bb87db8d72189bbd97d5e74815b977a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774743134","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgetable is a colourful single player point and click game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's about helping to detect misplaced items visitors have left behind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The menu shows an image of places (buildings) they visited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can start from any building and return to the menu at any time without losing progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no levels in the traditional sense. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a free\u2011choice experience: explore each building in any order until all are cleared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to find objects that are misplaced and don't belong to the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated duration ~ 1.5 - 2.5 hours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some scenes are hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use help through a phone button to navigate you through the search.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a cursor hint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clicking on object, click on pick up button. Menu appears on right click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no timer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are click and right click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are different 9+ scenes with 350+ objects to be found.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 achievements for finding 20, 100, 250 and 370 objects.</p>","developers":["Dijana Vucicevic"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119800/39b6a9688ec7b84909606e23cf0796e3934e65a0/header.jpg?t=1774743134","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Not allowed to resell.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4119800/99731501/29866d5a3b45c42fe21597f95555261ddbfa1a2f/1770671227/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770671622","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4119800/99731501/29866d5a3b45c42fe21597f95555261ddbfa1a2f/1770671227/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770671622","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4119800/99731501/29866d5a3b45c42fe21597f95555261ddbfa1a2f/1770671227/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770671622","id":257223274,"name"